comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T07:24:03.769Z",codex-agent,"Scope: companion item pm-cli-website-i3lk and proposal unbraind/pm-cli-companion#253. Local new package only; release remains held. Plan registered item fields, content digest revisions, root-bound file/JSON adapters, bounded checks and SDK relationship traversal. No git required on evidence paths."
  "2026-10-23T07:41:47.668Z",codex-agent,"Public-data proof: copied public pm-changelog origin/main tracker plus README/docs into a disposable non-git project; cited 20 fragments, then inserted lines, edited a passage, moved a paragraph, duplicated an anchor and removed a document in the copy. Results: resolved/current 16, resolved/changed 1, ambiguous/unknown 1, missing/unknown 2. Full check 2173 estimated tokens versus 17174 whole-document tokens (UTF-8 bytes/4). Budget 800 returned 6 and omitted 14. Scratch copy deleted. Details and reproducible harness will be linked with docs."
  "2026-10-23T07:49:32.738Z",codex-agent,"Final proof packet includes the exact current source revision as well as old/current fragment digests. Reran the complete public-data journey: same 16 current, 1 changed, 1 ambiguous and 2 missing; full check 2607 estimated tokens versus 17174 whole-document estimate. Budget 800 used 708, returned 5, omitted 15. Added checked-at timestamps to persisted last observations without changing deterministic check output. docs/real-data.md records this final measurement."
  "2026-10-23T08:02:17.861Z",codex-agent,All three behavioral negative controls failed their intended tests and restored source bytes exactly. A linked-test run overlapped those temporary guard removals and failed; the subsequent clean linked-test run passed after restoration. The append-only test history retains both outcomes. Final release gates run only against restored source.
  "2026-10-23T08:12:49.794Z",codex-agent,"Verified implementation head b909cb3: npm run release:check and bun run release:check each passed all 12 stages. Each ran 74 suite tests and 2 packed acceptance journeys covering npm/npx and Bun/bunx. Coverage: 1076/1076 statements and lines, 536/536 branches, 64/64 functions, 18 source files. Docstrings: 53/53 declarations across 18 files. Identity 0 violations; duplication 0 percent with 0 clone pairs; audit 0 vulnerabilities; pack 39 allowlisted files; attestation 1 protected publish invocation. Clean linked pm test run passed 19 tests. Three guard negative controls each failed 1 intended test and restored source exactly. Real-data final: 16 current, 1 changed, 1 ambiguous, 2 missing; 2607 versus 17174 estimated tokens; budget 800 returned 5, omitted 15, used 708. Remote mutation conformance remains explicitly unclaimed and tracked in pm-evidence-backend-conformance."
  "2026-10-23T08:51:10.679Z",codex-agent,"All three blocking PR 1 findings are implemented and covered by real no-git tracker regressions and function-only revert proofs. Targeted suite passed 9 tests; complete suite passed 84 tests with 100 percent statements, branches, functions and lines across 19 authored files. Public-data refresh: 15 current, 1 changed, 2 ambiguous, 2 missing. Lost-context paragraph movement now correctly requires review. Complete npm and Bun release gates follow before the feature-only push; no review-thread replies or mentions are needed."
  "2026-10-23T09:06:44.213Z",codex-agent,"Final PR 1 fixes passed npm run release:check under an isolated home and Git configuration, and bun run release:check: all 12 stages each, 84 suite tests plus 2 packed consumer journeys each. Coverage 1167/1167 statements and lines, 617/617 branches, 74/74 functions across 19 authored files. Docstrings 55/55; duplication 0 percent and 0 clone pairs; identity 0 violations; audit 0 vulnerabilities; pack 43 allowlisted files; 1 attested publish invocation. Focused linked tests passed 9 cases for check, adapters and review. Four function-only negative controls each failed 1 intended regression, including inherited heading scope. Source was restored exactly before all positive gates. No new pm SDK gap was needed; the existing remote-backend follow-up stays open. Claims released for orchestrator review; no items closed."
